


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_6f4c4406:


    "周日上午。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_27778a49:


    "伦在客厅懒洋洋的宅着。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_a3490575:



    voice "2HI_0854"
    hina "「那我出去咯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_2b6eace2:


    "阳菜穿着校服从卧室走出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_a7b1c0a8:



    voice "2RI_0845"
    rin "「咦，今天是去社团帮忙的日子？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_d415256f:


    "翻过身抬头看向阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_94c10230:



    voice "2HI_0855"
    hina "「对，今天是去垒球和篮球队帮忙」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_19dd2675:



    voice "2RI_0846"
    rin "「我去，连着两场吗！？体力真充沛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_6e2ee50d:



    voice "2HI_0856"
    hina "「毕竟垒球在之前就拜托我帮忙了，篮球也是比赛的时候去下就行」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_d0bf9cb5:



    voice "2RI_0847"
    rin "「这么小只的身体到底从哪弄出来这么强的体能的……啊，难道阳菜其实是原子能驱动的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_c3e0d624:



    voice "2HI_0857"
    hina "「我是靠吃饭才有的能量！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_a6d41305:



    voice "2RI_0848"
    rin "「话说，帮忙有钱拿吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_95d01935:



    voice "2HI_0858"
    hina "「有提成」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_84344912:



    voice "2RI_0849"
    rin "「需不需要中介？伦·绪方可是很有才能的喔？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_ba004780:



    voice "2HI_0859"
    hina "「不需要。不说这个了，冰箱里有小文做好的午饭，你要是饿了记得去吃」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_10234291:



    voice "2RI_0850"
    rin "「啊嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_c6b40b0b:



    voice "2HI_0860"
    hina "「要用微波炉热下，知道怎么热吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_f5f548dc:



    voice "2RI_0851"
    rin "「知道，你以为我做了多少年看家的了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_e5a944b5:



    voice "2HI_0861"
    hina "「好好，记得也和圣夜子说一声啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_12e00866:



    voice "2RI_0852"
    rin "「嗯～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_16b54170:



    voice "2HI_0862"
    hina "「嘿咻」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_4428d3fa:


    "阳菜这么说着便背起了装着服装和道具的大包。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_049ab585:



    voice "2RI_0853"
    rin "「你直接进个社团算了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_360dbf94:



    voice "2HI_0863"
    hina "「确实有被人劝过正式加入社团」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_4b72d908:



    voice "2RI_0854"
    rin "「而且还是好几个社团问你的吧？除了专用运动服，连自己社团用的鞋和道具什么的都给你备好了，完全是VIP待遇啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_94501206:



    voice "2HI_0864"
    hina "「但我不会进的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_7d422f2e:



    voice "2RI_0855"
    rin "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_de1d481f:



    voice "2HI_0865"
    hina "「因为那样和小文在一起的时间就少了♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_8716bf4b:


    "哼哼地笑着说道后，阳菜在脖子上围上围巾。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_c6569fc9:



    voice "2HI_0866"
    hina "「那我出门了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_02_cb80cee1:



    voice "2RI_0856"
    rin "「可恶，现充的余裕吗……」"
